---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import arekImage from '../assets/arek.jpeg';
const siteTitle = 'Fully Fit Studio';
---

<Layout title={`${siteTitle} | Contact`}>
  <main style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem;">
    <section style="text-align: center; padding: 1rem 0;">
      <h1 style="color: #d1d5db;">Our Trainers</h1>
      <!-- p style="color: #d1d5db; font-size: 1.2rem;">We look forward to working with you.</p -->
    </section>

    <!-- Areks profile -->
    <section style="margin-top: 2rem; border: 1px solid #ccc; border-radius: 8px; background: white; padding: 2rem;">
      <h2 style="color: #000000; margin-top: 0;">Arek Kubicki</h2>
      <img
        src={arekImage.src}
        alt="Arek Kubicki"
        style="float: right; width: 280px; height: auto; margin-left: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; border-radius: 8px; object-fit: cover;"
      />
      <p>As a father, business owner, and personal trainer with over 20 years of experience in the fitness industry, Arek brings a wealth of knowledge, experience, and genuine passion to every client he works with.</p>
      <p>His approach is simple: help people become stronger, healthier, and more confident while working towards goals that matter to them. Whether it’s achieving a major transformation, improving fitness, building strength, or simply feeling better day to day, Arek is passionate about helping people reach their goals — big or small.</p>
      <p>With two decades of hands-on experience, Arek understands that everyone is different. He takes the time to understand each person’s needs and creates practical, achievable training approaches designed to deliver lasting results.</p>
      <p>For Arek, personal training is about more than just exercise — it’s about helping people believe in themselves and become the best version of who they can be.</p>
      <h3 style="color: #000000;">Specialties</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Weight Loss</li>
        <li>Body transformation</li>
        <li>Sport specific training</li>
        <li>New to exercise</li>
        <li>Core strength</li>
        <li>Small group training</li>
        <li>Strength and conditioning</li>
        <li>Muscle toning</li>
        <li>Nutrition guidance</li>
      </ul>
      <h3 style="color: #000000;">Contact Arek</h3>
      <p>Email: <a href="mailto:arek@fullyfit.co.nz">arek@fullyfit.co.nz</a></p>
      <p>Phone: 022 087 3930</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Sachas profile -->
    <section style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; margin-top: 2rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
      <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 2rem; border-radius: 8px; flex: 1; min-width: 220px; background: white;">
        <h3 style="color: #000000;">Sacha Donovan</h3>
        <p>Strength and conditioning coach - profile coming soon.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Contact details -->
    <section style="margin-top: 2rem; border: 1px solid #ccc; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.5rem; background: white;">
      <h3 style="color: #000000;">Visit us</h3>
      <p>Fully Fit PT Studio <br /> 178 Hibiscus Coast Highway <br /> Auckland <br /> New Zealand
      </p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-top: 2rem; border: 1px solid #ccc; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: white;">
      <iframe
        title="Fully Fit Studio location"
        src="https://www.google.com/maps?q=178%20Hibiscus%20Coast%20Highway%20New%20Zealand&z=12&output=embed"
        width="100%"
        height="350"
        style="border: 0; display: block;"
        loading="lazy"
        referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"
      ></iframe>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
